TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell SI_H2Og
10 PUNCH TRANSPORT_STEP_NO, CELL_NO, SI("H2O(g)")

END
